WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.970
*dark choral music with intense drums*

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:07.260
Problem is... If you fight with an edge blade... I'll have to.

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:11.880
And if I fight with an edge blade... I'll have no one left to pay me. 

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:15.840
I get away from the hustlin' crowd...

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:21.120
And all that rat race noise down in the street. 

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:26.730
Send Rob Stark's head... I'm going to serve it to Sansa at my wedding feast. 

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.710
It's you isn't it?

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:30.360
*adults fighting offscreen*

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.670
The other kids won't believe me.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:35.310
Your brother is a killer...

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:38.280
Your sons will be killers some day...

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:40.920
*celtic violin* 

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:45.210
There's oats, and there's oats... But there's only one Scott's Porage Oats. 

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:51.810
My husband trusted you... and you repaid our faith with treachery. 

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.700
I didn't ask the gods what it meant... I didn't need to.

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.020
I already knew.

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:06.660
Don't worry Harry we'll explain everything when we get back to headquarters. 

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.300
Shhh! Not here Nymphadora.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.600
Don't call me Nymphadora. 

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:20.850
I wish I had enough poison for the whole pack of you. I would gladly give my life to watch you all swallow it. 

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:22.830
Hot date last night?

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.810
I wish.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:28.440
A women with a sexy voice like yours, it's hard to believe you're waking up alone.

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:32.400
Each wanting to grow the tallest, bloom the brightest...

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.700
And one by one sooner or later they all get plucked.

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:38.010
My lord, the fleet has moved out of lightspeed...

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:45.270
Com-Scan has detected an energy field protecting an area of the sixth planet of the Hoth system. The field is strong enough to deflect any bombardment. 

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:47.910
Chaos isn't a pit...

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:50.550
Chaos is a ladder.

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:06.390
A sorcerer called and a voice answered. And ever since that day I have hated magic.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:10.680
Go out. Out there under the sky, look around. What is the saying? 

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.310
Distance lends enchantment to the viewer.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:18.600
Which would have given us more time to deal with Robert's brothers, but now...

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:22.890
Madness... madness, and stupidity. 

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:23.880
Or what?

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:26.520
Or nipple cripple... That's what! 

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.430
Caved in his breastplate...

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:37.740
Probably shattered every rib he had.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.380
And that's another thing... enough with the dumb-dumb

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:46.320
My name is Fred Flintstone. F.L.I.N... T... Stone.

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:59.520
Would you shut up for once in your life... I said I was sorry!

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:01.170
I meant it.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:06.450
And that's all I gotta' say, you understand... Last time I checked we weren't married... Or even related.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:10.080
So you better stop throwing your crazy guilt around, before I throw you through the damn window!

